About the character: concept and design by the author; the artwork was rendered
with AI assistance (ChatGPT), then split into layers, pivoted and rigged by
hand. Purely AI-rendered images may not qualify for copyright protection in
some jurisdictions; the layer split, pivots and rig are the author's own work.

